{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "5c5a2b1e-9f2e-4f2c-9a7f-bookverse01",
    "name": "BookVerse API",
    "description": "End-to-end collection for the BookVerse e-book REST API.\n\n## How to use\n\n1. Import this collection + one of the environments (`bookverse.local.postman_environment.json` or `bookverse.prod.postman_environment.json`).\n2. Select the environment so `{{baseUrl}}` resolves.\n3. Start the app (`mvn spring-boot:run` — H2 in-memory DB, seeded with 500 books).\n4. Run the collection: **BookVerse API → ▸ ▸ Run collection**.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Every folder runs in dependency order (seed a book, then read/update/delete it). Run the whole collection, or run each folder in order.\n- Tests validate HTTP status + JSON schema/values and capture ids via `pm.collectionVariables` (see Test Results → collectionVariables after the run).\n- Bulk import tests use the files under `postman/` (relative to your working dir): `sample-books.csv`, `sample-books-dup.csv`, `sample-books-bad.csv`.\n- Cover-upload tests use `sample-cover.png` (valid PNG) and `sample-unsupported.txt` (invalid).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "bookId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Id of the last created book (captured by tests)."
    },
    {
      "key": "coverId",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Id of the book created with a cover (captured by tests)."
    },
    {
      "key": "coverPath",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "coverPath of the created book with cover (captured by tests)."
    },
    {
      "key": "isbn",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Generated unique ISBN (set by pre-request scripts)."
    },
    {
      "key": "title",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Generated unique title (set by pre-request scripts)."
    },
    {
      "key": "author",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Generated author name (set by pre-request scripts)."
    },
    {
      "key": "coverIsbn",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Generated unique ISBN for the cover-upload book."
    },
    {
      "key": "coverTitle",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Generated unique title for the cover-upload book."
    },
    {
      "key": "invalidCoverIsbn",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Generated unique ISBN for the invalid-cover book."
    }
